v1.2.0                                                      2020-02-02

    * Toolbar with buttons to add, select, remove files.
    * Program can be run without files as arguments.
    * Checkboxes to select files to apply changes.
    * Labels with file type.
    * Buttons for item to restore original name and delete item.
    * Source code updates.

